Theophrastus
Copyright 2026 Centre for Language Technology, University of Copenhagen

Theophrastus began as a fork of Aristotle
(https://github.com/arachne-framework/aristotle), written by Luke
VanderHart and licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It has since been
rewritten: it moved to Apache Jena 6, replaced Aristotle's query DSL with
SPARQL and its registry with Jena's prefix mappings, and took over code
from DanNet for transactions, TDB2, rules, SPARQL functions and SHACL.
